OL,3,AMigraines and acne among five more
OL,4,Aconditions pharmacists can treat
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS England said the move was to ease
OL,7,Fpressure on busy GPs and A&E
OL,8,Fdepartments while making sure people
OL,9,Fcould get treatment quickly and
OL,10,Fconveniently.
